(848, 'PHC-20260623-774A996C', '2026-06-23', '08:53:00', NULL, 'ambulance', '{\"type\":\"ambulance\",\"id\":\"V18\"}', 'J PACHECO', 'POBLACION HILL SITE', '08:58:00', 'POBLACION HILL SITE', '09:19:00', 'AMH', '09:38:00', NULL, '10:00:00', '10:30:00', '[]', 'CANDRALO ROSABEL LAGUEN', '2010-06-03', 16, 'years', 'adult', 'female', 'single', 'MASICAL', '7', 'STUDENT', NULL, NULL, '07:00:00', 'ROWENA CANDRALO', 'MASICAL', 'call', '08:52:00', '09277699549', 'MOTHER', '[]', NULL, 'uploads/patient_docs/2026-06-23/patient_20260623161424_3c12706f08028619493e0a370682b008.jpeg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 'RIGHT LOWER QUARANT PAIN,EPIGASTRIC PAIN', 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '[]', '2LPM VIA NASAL CANNULA', 'VITAL SIGNS TAKEN AND RECORDED', '08:58:00', '140/100', 36.2, 106, 13, NULL, 99, 'no', '[\"alert\",\"pain\"]', NULL, '09:15:00', '150/100', 36.2, 95, 13, NULL, 99, 'no', '[\"alert\",\"pain\"]', '[\"headache\",\"dizziness\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"signs\":\"RIGHT LOWER QUADRANT PAIN(ADDOMEN)DIZZINESS AND HEADACHE,RI\",\"allergies\":\"NONE\",\"medications\":\"ASCORBIC ACID\",\"pertinent\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"last_intake\":\"EGG,RICE\",\"events\":\"SITTING ON CHAIR\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RESPONDED TO MEDICAL PATIENT AWAKE,CONSCIOUS AND COHERENT,WITH CHIEF COMPLAINT OF PAIN INH HER ABDOMEN(RIGHT LOWER QUADRANT PAIN) AND EPIGASTRIC PAIN,HEADACHE AND DIZZINESS,,VITAL SIGNS TAKEN AND MONITORED,ASSISTED AND HOOKED OXYGEN @2LPM VIA NASAL CANNULA..TRANSPORTED AND ENDORSED TO ALCALA MUNICIPAL HOSPITAL FOR FURTHER MANAGEMENT', 'G LUCENA', 'G LUCENA', NULL, 'K SALVADOR', NULL, NULL, 'AMH', NULL, '2026-06-23 09:38:00', 'RESCUE 116 EMS Team G LUCENA\r\n\r\nName/Nature of Incident / Mechanism of Injury:\r\nMedical (RIGHT LOWER QUARANT PAIN,EPIGASTRIC PAIN)\r\n\r\nPlace of Incident: Not specified\r\nDate of Incident: June 23, 2026\r\nTime of Response: 8:53 AM AM\r\n\r\nPatient Information:\r\nFemale, 16 years old\r\nResident of MASICAL, 7\r\n\r\nAssessment:\r\nUpon arrival at the scene, the patient was found awake and coherent, responsive to pain stimuli only. \r\n\r\nPhysical examination revealed:\r\n- Headache\r\n- Dizziness\r\n\r\nInitial Vital Signs:\r\n- Blood Pressure: 140/100\r\n- Temperature: 36.2°C\r\n- Pulse: 106 BPM\r\n- Respiratory Rate: 13\r\n- SPO2: 99%\r\n\r\nFollow-up Assessment:\r\nPatient condition: awake and coherent, responsive to pain stimuli only. \r\n- Blood Pressure: 150/100\r\n- Temperature: 36.2°C\r\n- Pulse: 95 BPM\r\n- Respiratory Rate: 13\r\n- SPO2: 99%\r\n\r\nManagement Provided:\r\n- Initial assessment conducted\r\n- Vital signs taken and documented\r\n- Oxygen administered: 2LPM VIA NASAL CANNULA\r\n- VITAL SIGNS TAKEN AND RECORDED\r\n- Patient positioned in a position of comfort during transport\r\n\r\nThe patient was transported and formally endorsed to AMH for further evaluation, diagnostic procedures, and definitive medical management.\r\n\r\nFor emergencies, please contact 0966-206-8444.', 'uploads/endorsements/2026-06-23/endorsement_20260623161424_2987b91f89ce9021177baa1818d2a419.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, '2026-06-23 08:02:21', '2026-06-23 08:14:24', 'completed'),
